{"title": "Vampire Ascendant", "pageid": 23177, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vampire_Ascendant", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bulette_Bite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Bulette_Bite.webp/300px-Bulette_Bite.webp, /w/images/7/7a/Bulette_Bite.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Bulette_Bite.webp/300px-Bulette_Bite.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Bulette_Bite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Vampire Ascendant</b> is a passive feature available to <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a> if he completes his <a href=\"/wiki/The_Pale_Elf\" title=\"The Pale Elf\">quest</a> by ascending. It gives him the class actions <a href=\"/wiki/Ascendant_Bite\" title=\"Ascendant Bite\">Ascendant Bite</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Escape_(Vampire_Ascendant)\" title=\"Misty Escape (Vampire Ascendant)\">Misty Escape (Vampire Ascendant)</a>, as well as a bonus <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage to weapon and unarmed attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Behold, the Vampire Ascendant! Thousands of souls have bought you power, granting you <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascendant_Bite\" title=\"Ascendant Bite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp/25px-Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp/38px-Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp/50px-Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ascendant Bite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp/25px-Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ascendant_Bite\" title=\"Ascendant Bite\">Ascendant Bite</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Escape_(Vampire_Ascendant)\" title=\"Misty Escape (Vampire Ascendant)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/25px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/38px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/50px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gaseous Form\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/25px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Escape_(Vampire_Ascendant)\" title=\"Misty Escape (Vampire Ascendant)\">Gaseous Form</a>.\n</p><p>You also have a +<span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage bonus to weapon and unarmed attacks. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascendant_Bite\" title=\"Ascendant Bite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp/40px-Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp/60px-Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp/80px-Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ascendant Bite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp/40px-Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Bulette_Bite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ascendant_Bite\" title=\"Ascendant Bite\">Ascendant Bite</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Escape_(Vampire_Ascendant)\" title=\"Misty Escape (Vampire Ascendant)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/40px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/60px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/80px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Misty Escape (Vampire Ascendant)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/40px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Escape_(Vampire_Ascendant)\" title=\"Misty Escape (Vampire Ascendant)\">Misty Escape (Vampire Ascendant)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p><p>Only available to <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a> after becoming an ascendant vampire.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Does not seem to apply when <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/38px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/50px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"wild shaped\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">wild shaped</a>, except for forms that attack with weapons.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The in-game description states Astarion gains a +<span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage bonus to <b><a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a></b>. This appears to be a typo, as attack rolls are what decide if one hits or misses rather than how much damage they deal.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195238\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2387/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20983/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9959/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 857550/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.543      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   45.543      1 -total\n 45.59%   20.764      8 Template:Icon_link\n 43.89%   19.987      8 Template:Icon_text\n 38.33%   17.458     31 Template:Trim\n 36.58%   16.659      1 Template:PageSeo\n 35.90%   16.352      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 32.69%   14.887      3 Template:DamageText\n 28.78%   13.107      3 Template:Damage_type\n 20.59%    9.375      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:23177-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195238 and revision id 356067. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}